      "created_at": "2016-05-16T02:15:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Makes sense, thanks. One of my friends is starting this game, more interested in the story. Last I had checked (a while ago, obviously sometime last year, or maybe the year before), I had seen the SotM site and referred my friend to it. The next day, he asked me about VotM and Oblivaeon. I said Oblivaeon was new, but Votm had been around for a few months. He then asked me why it asnt on the website, sparking this whole thread.</p>",
