      "created_at": "2016-05-21T00:05:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you are looking for VotM lore stuff, the rules books is the only place.  I am sure there is a pdf about. While you there can you find all the weird things in it.</p>\n<p>For Oblivaeon, on the Sotm wikia search of ARG. There is a good set up for the final thing. It was a fun lore filled event.</p>\n<p>Also he can go down the Foote note rabid hole here in these forms. He has done a few lore post. Does anyone know any more.</p>\n<p>I love the lore of this game. Now if someone can explain Quando? Ahora! (Love talking about that card.)</p>",
